{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_45680","headline":"送僧入马头山 · 贯休","name":"送僧入马头山","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"马头宝峰，秀塞寒空。\n有叟有叟，真隐其中。\n无味醍醐，亦非般若。\n白趾碧目，数百潇洒。\n苦竹大於杉，白熊卧如马。\n金锺撼壑，布水喷瓦。\n芙蓉堂开峰月入，岳精踏雪立屋下。\n伊余解攀缘，已是非常者。\n更有叟，独往来，与我语。\n情无刚强，气透今古。\n竹笠援补，芒鞋藤乳。\n北风倒人，乾雪不聚。\n满头霜雪汤雪去，汤雪去。\n无人及，空望真气江上立。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"贯休","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_45680.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_45680","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}